%% re-render after editing: mmdc -i encryption-layers.mmd -o encryption-layers.svg
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Consumer
    participant K as Coordinator
    participant P as Provider

    Note over C,K: Hop 1 (optional) — sender sealing
    C->>K: GET /v1/encryption-key
    K-->>C: {public_key, kid, algorithm: x25519-xsalsa20-poly1305}
    C->>K: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Content-Type: application/vnd.eigen.sealed+json<br/>{kid, sender_public_key, nonce, ciphertext}
    Note over K: NaCl Box open with coordinator X25519 key<br/>(HKDF of mnemonic, info "eigeninference-coordinator-e2e-v1")<br/>plaintext lives in memory only

    Note over K,P: Hop 2 (mandatory) — coordinator → provider
    K->>P: inference_request<br/>encrypted_body = Box(sessionPriv, providerPub K)<br/>session_public_key, nonce
    Note over P: X25519 K decrypts — plaintext exists only inside the provider process

    Note over P,K: Hop 3 (mandatory) — provider → coordinator
    P->>K: inference_response_chunk<br/>encrypted_data = Box(K, sessionPub)<br/>sender_public_key must equal K
    Note over K: precomputed shared key per (SessionPrivKey, K)<br/>chunkKeyCacheMax = 256

    Note over K,C: Response returns on hop 1
    K-->>C: X-Eigen-Sealed: 1, X-Eigen-Sealed-Kid,<br/>X-Provider-*, X-Attestation-Se-Public-Key<br/>(sealed to the caller's sender key when hop 1 was used)
